      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `c259140d1230a579e7758507043ff8fc3f170612381e25b39ca73586d8bc05a7--home-security-measures-tables-29---36a-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2017-18\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 17 of 17\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6d3834f115649b779c9e1ed9dbb4c767b93247fe7f95ba31365fb2f68a1b6d54 | missing |\n| \"Table 29\" | 95c702bb0c69682e895cd51485f66692afb43151ca994d2a34453ac134de85a0 | missing |\n| \"Table 29a\" | 6d3bff97048f270c307db4df925d5d0f372e538dfd2ae131add6b045cf1f97f3 | missing |\n| \"Table 30\" | 175d9b85f989ca6cac66b394148cddc07b048e41781186577808d9fb76d90ca0 | missing |\n| \"Table 30a\" | a4e007b9cd0a74978e25a294548d4a6c5a329c0c3f4a661dcaf5ef29beb18348 | missing |\n| \"Table 31\" | 21d7a269fa2e01823791af16c3615eff42c2b6608842b4b9d0a8c16c86565df9 | missing |\n| \"Table 31a\" | b94768f347986e1a22adb85d997004390a50a569289bbcaaaa9158f5e8b637f2 | missing |\n| \"Table 32\" | f95db7c8d7ec33111dc163c301ac7b50babc0581e4c139e6a5df6bd53d47843c | missing |\n| \"Table 32a\" | bfb477858387ac91f37513735444dc2ad11a94857451b85898999637f260ce71 | missing |\n| \"Table 33\" | 3549f391c74fb33ead372fdf7f961139045d79f4832288c489b63705cdad2a9c | missing |\n| \"Table 33a\" | 367a4df5960885b0d63c89c748c3446d94921852679aeed6464a400b9dba4e43 | missing |\n| \"Table 34\" | c1efd5b1fa70802e04f4538721c0d7a25eb476dd4fe473b46d47fe3238b4a117 | missing |\n| \"Table 34a\" | 2d6216dbe7d043239df539ac2f012766e5cb83db4eb400ab9a02aaa875e25b2d | missing |\n| \"Table 35\" | 0cdb8b0015237aa0b58d9c2d4d16411dc3fba0085e25c356ce301e1cb83b99b5 | missing |\n| \"Table 35a\" | 55bce61f0824eb2a902799df76691b8088edfbaf9c2e1f5a07480ea37019d57a | missing |\n| \"Table 36\" | 117e9cf6828686eb81468c249959b834c61cec379c7b2afdfcb5450b000a2886 | missing |\n| \"Table 36a\" | e21cd579119babd0a740b56436e86cea00b03c79da9adae3fb3015783db476da | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
